 *
 * The repository does not contain the complete deployed Firestore rules.
 * Merge these matches into that complete source, preserve the existing
 * subscriptions_manual rules unchanged, and inspect/narrow every broader
 * wildcard allow. In Firestore Rules, a false result here does not override
 * a true result from another matching rule.
